<title>USA: Service Experts says option exercised.</title>
<headline>Service Experts says option exercised.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Service Experts Inc said on Friday that underwriters had exercised an over-allotment option to buy 337,500 Service Experts shares at $13 each.</p>
<p>The option was granted in connection with the company's initial public offering of 2.25 million shares on August 16.</p>
<p>Proceeds of the over-allotment were about $4.1 million, increasing net proceeds of the offering to $31.3 million, Service Experts said.</p>
<p>Equitable Securities Corp and Morgan Keegan &amp; Co were managing underwriters of the offering.</p>
